- Identifying positive external environmental opportunities early enables a pioneering enterprise to obtain *First Mover Advantage*.
- By recognizing the latent consumer demand for economical, compact family cars ahead of competitors, Maruti captured an unassailable market leadership position.
Therefore, Maruti obtained *First Mover Advantage* (Option B).], answer: [B])

